      "Forms and submission: acknowledge each submit immediately, prevent duplicates, validate as people go where it helps and keep their data on error.",
      "Navigation and search: make the current location and the effect of filters visible; the browser's back button must return people to the state they expect.",
      "Loading and error states: show progress for slow operations, say what failed and how to retry, and do not lose work on a timeout.",
